"keyboard works."
msgstr ""
"Tessdeḍ 2 n tqeffalin ɣef tikkelt neɣ taqeffalt Shift 5 n tikkal. Wa d "
"anegzum n usexsi n tqeffalin timenzugin, i yettbeddilen tikli n unasiw-ik."

